            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "keyboardNav": {
            "description": "FR-5 — keyboard navigation of the data points (roving tabindex). When `true`\n(or implied by wiring `onSelectKey`), a thin focusable overlay is rendered\nover the points: the chart owns ONE tab stop, ←/↑/→/↓ move the focus between\npoints (data order), Home/End jump to the first/last, Enter/Space select the\nfocused point (`onSelectKey`), Escape leaves the navigation. Each focused\npoint announces its key + value. Absent ⇒ no overlay, rendering unchanged.",
